      "text": [
        " \"اَلْوُلْدُ أَحْرَارٌ\" ثُمَّ قَالَ \"إِذَا كَانَ أَحَدُ وَالِدَيْهِ حُرّاً فَالْوَلَدُ حُرٌّ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4580 - Abu Abdillah (as) was asked about a free man who marries a bondwoman belonging to a people. Are the children considered slaves or free?\nImam (as) said: \"The children are free.\"\nThen Imam (as) added: \"If one of the parents is free, the child is free.\""
        ]
      }
